 listing with no backlink","Google sign-in gates the form","No published review time","Accepts SaaS, AI tools, developer tools and web apps"]', rw_submission_checks='["Sign in with Google to see the form.","Expect no published review timeline.","Ten sister sites share the engine, so reach overlaps."]', rw_seo_title='SaaS Crawler: Free Dofollow Listing, DR 27', rw_seo_description='How to submit to SaaS Crawler: free dofollow SaaS listing behind a Google login, no backlink. Shared-engine caveat from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='saas-crawler';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='Names itself a state of the market, and runs the same ten-site engine as its siblings.', rw_what_you_get='A dofollow listing available after a Google login, in one of ten near-identical directories.', rw_you_need='["A live public URL","A Google account — the only sign-in offered"]', rw_eligibility='You need a live URL and a Google account. Nothing is published about who is refused.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Open the submit page. /submit shows a Log in to Submit panel instead of the form.","2 Log in with Google — the sole provider, with a Create an account link.","3 Complete the listing form, which only appears after login.","4 Wait. No review time is published anywhere on the site."]', rw_submit_requirements='["A live public URL","A Google account","A category from their tree"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Nothing published about who is refused"]', rw_gotchas='["The submit route reveals only a login panel, so the form''s fields are impossible to review before signing in.","Every page carries a sponsored ad for a paid service submitting to roughly 140 directories, a rival marked sponsored nofollow.","Ten sites share this exact codebase and copy, differing only in name and accent colour, so submitting across them delivers far less unique value than the count implies."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does SaaS State approval take?","answer":"No review time is published."},{"question":"Is submitting to SaaS State free?","answer":"Yes, submission is free."},{"question":"Does a listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 27."},{"question":"Do I need to link back?","answer":"No backlink is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Nothing published about who is refused."}]', rw_summary='SaaS State is a free dofollow SaaS directory on a shared ten-site engine, gated behind a Google login. No backlink or published review time; domain rating is 27.', rw_fact_points='["Free dofollow listing with no backlink","Form requires Google sign-in","No published review time","Accepts SaaS, AI tools, developer tools and web apps"]', rw_submission_checks='["Sign in with Google before the form appears.","No review timeline to plan around.","Reach overlaps with nine sister sites on the same engine."]', rw_seo_title='SaaS State: Free Dofollow Listing, DR 27', rw_seo_description='How to submit to SaaS State: free dofollow SaaS listing behind a Google login, no backlink. Shared-engine caveat from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='saas-state';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='A registry for MCP servers, agent apps and CLI tools that wants your GitHub repo rather than your product, and links to it nofollow.', rw_what_you_get='A listing in an MCP and agent registry, linked nofollow — worth it for the audience, not the link equity.', rw_you_need='["A public GitHub repository — the form asks for the repo, not the product","A name and an author or organisation"]', rw_eligibility='You need a public repository and a name. Products with no repo to point at, and anything outside the MCP, agent app or agent CLI space, are rejected.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Pick the right queue. /en/submit has three flows: Submit MCP for server repos, Submit Agent APP for a scheduled product profile, and Submit Agent CLI for command-line tools.","2 Give the repo. GitHub Repository URL, MCP name and author are required; an auto-fill button reads the repo and populates the rest.","3 Add optional detail: an avatar URL, a contact email never shown publicly, and a description. A newsletter checkbox is ticked by default.","4 Wait for review. Submissions are reviewed before publishing, but no timeframe is given and no reference is issued."]', rw_submit_requirements='["A public GitHub repository URL","A name and author or organisation","An optional avatar URL","A contact email, never displayed","An optional description"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Products with no repository to point at, and anything outside the MCP, agent app or agent CLI space"]', rw_gotchas='["Listings link to the repository with rel=nofollow while the site''s own partner links are dofollow — come for the audience, not the link.","It wants a repository, not a product; a closed-source MCP server has nothing to submit, the same wall the official registry puts up.","No review time is published, no reference id is issued and the form just redirects to the homepage, so there is nothing to chase if it never appears."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does MCP Hub approval take?","answer":"No review time is published; submissions are reviewed before publishing."},{"question":"Is submitting to MCP Hub free?","answer":"Yes, submission is free."},{"question":"Does a listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"No — listing links to GitHub are nofollow on a domain rated 25, while partner links are dofollow."},{"question":"Do I need to link back?","answer":"No backlink is required."},{"question":"What gets a submission rejected?","answer":"No public repository, or anything outside MCP servers, agent apps and agent CLIs."}]', rw_summary='MCP Hub is a free registry for MCP servers, agent apps and CLI tools where listings link to your GitHub repo nofollow. No backlink is required; domain rating is 25.', rw_fact_points='["Free listing reviewed before publishing, no published timeline","Listing link to GitHub is nofollow","No badge or return link is expected","Accepts MCP servers, agent skills, AI tools and developer tools"]', rw_submission_checks='["Have a public GitHub repository — product-only entries do not fit.","Choose the right queue: MCP, agent app or agent CLI.","Expect no reference or status page after submitting."]', rw_seo_title='MCP Hub: Free MCP Listing, DR 25', rw_seo_description='How to submit to MCP Hub: free MCP/agent registry listing from your GitHub repo, nofollow link, no backlink. Steps from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='aimcp';
